    <h2 style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:72px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#f3f6fb;margin:0;">The maturity ladder</h2>
    <p style="font-size:29px;line-height:1.5;color:#aab2c0;margin:30px 0 30px;">Each rung fixes something the previous one left open — all the way to ASDT.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;color:#9aa3b2;">
