<aside class="notes">Dogfooding: this very deck went through six specialists, with a human checkpoint between each one and every handoff as a written document. And it's not just the deck — the ASDT CLI itself and this documentation site were built with the same pipeline. ASDT is built with ASDT. The deck is its own proof. It wasn't linear either: there were back-and-forths between QA and UX/UI, each one approved by a human.</aside>
