    <h2 style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:62px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#f3f6fb;margin:0;">Six words, no jargon</h2>
    <p style="font-size:26px;line-height:1.4;color:#9aa3b2;margin:16px 0 0;">Three families. Read them left to right — that's almost the whole language of ASDT.</p>
