    <div class="au d1" style="flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px;min-height:0;">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:0 4px 2px;"><span style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:oklch(75% .145 195);"></span><span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono';font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(80% .1 195);font-weight:600;">What stays written</span></div>
      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-left:3px solid oklch(75% .145 195);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;margin-bottom:8px;"><span style="color:oklch(80% .12 195);font-size:21px;">▣</span><span style="font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-size:25px;font-weight:600;color:#eef1f6;">Document</span></div>
        <p style="font-size:21px;line-height:1.4;color:#aab2c0;margin:0;">What a step leaves in writing, at a fixed address: the next step finds it there. It outlives the chat.</p>
