        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;margin-bottom:8px;"><span style="color:oklch(80% .12 195);font-size:21px;">✦</span><span style="font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-size:25px;font-weight:600;color:#eef1f6;">Summary</span></div>
        <p style="font-size:21px;line-height:1.4;color:#aab2c0;margin:0;">The short note each specialist leaves at the end. Nobody hands it over: future work finds it by searching.</p>
