        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;margin-bottom:8px;"><span style="color:oklch(80% .12 195);font-size:21px;">→</span><span style="font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-size:25px;font-weight:600;color:#eef1f6;">Step</span></div>
        <p style="font-size:21px;line-height:1.4;color:#aab2c0;margin:0;">One concrete, isolated task: it reads its inputs and leaves exactly one document. Nothing more.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

