      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-left:3px solid oklch(76% .145 75);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;margin-bottom:8px;"><span style="color:oklch(82% .12 75);font-size:21px;">◎</span><span style="font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-size:25px;font-weight:600;color:#eef1f6;">Specialist</span></div>
        <p style="font-size:21px;line-height:1.4;color:#aab2c0;margin:0;">A role with its own lens — research, design, test, secure — that orders and runs its own steps, one after another.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-left:3px solid oklch(76% .145 75);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;margin-bottom:8px;"><span style="color:oklch(82% .12 75);font-size:21px;">⌥</span><span style="font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-size:25px;font-weight:600;color:#eef1f6;">Router</span></div>
        <p style="font-size:21px;line-height:1.4;color:#aab2c0;margin:0;">It hears your request and tells you which specialist to call first. It recommends — never executes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="au d3" style="flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px;min-height:0;">
