    <p style="font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-size:26px;font-weight:600;margin:34px 0 0;text-align:center;"><span style="color:oklch(80% .12 245);">Documents survive.</span> <span style="color:#9aa3b2;">Conversations don't.</span></p>
